<div class="nr">
	<div class="main_bd">
	         <div class="con_title">
   <h2 class="title">6金3银！校田径队在省运会创佳绩</h2>
   <p class="info">来源：<span class="xxly">
    </span>时间：<span class="time1">2026-07-07</span>点击数：<i class="djs"><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1641759486, 7322)</script></i></p>
                 </div>



    <div id="vsb_content_2" class="content"><div class="v_news_content">
<p class="vsbcontent_start" style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">（通讯员 纪旺旺 董颖初）2026年6月30日—7月5日，陕西省第十八届运动会（大学生组）田径项目在渭南市体育中心举行。我校选派8名甲、乙组运动员参赛，在陕西省第十八届运动会大学生组田径比赛中获得6金、3银、第四2项、第六1项、第七1项的佳绩。</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/A/ED/0D/E0766EE7AA3191C52797714770D_04A8A638_3141C.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/AED0DE0766EE7AA3191C52797714770D/04A8A638/3141C" vheight=" 298.15pt" vwidth=" 414.7pt" orisrc="/__local/3/F4/CC/3A1223AAE2F0702C278AA8283DA_708ED7C5_2F21D.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 414.7pt;height: 298.15pt"></p><p style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">据悉，作为陕西省规格最高、规模最大、影响力最广的综合性体育盛会，本次大学生田径赛事汇聚全省41所高校，共计439名运动健儿齐聚赛场。本次西电代表队由体育部副部长张超、田径俱乐部乔小杉、纪旺旺组成教练团队。参赛队员们的年级从大一到研一，专业覆盖运动训练专业到各学院各专业。</span></p><p style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">此次省运会既是一次检验，更是一次激励，田径队全体师生将以此为新的起点，总结宝贵经验，继续砥砺前行，力争在更高水平的赛场上再创辉煌，为我校体育事业高质量发展贡献更大力量！</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/D/4E/01/3C687F9E1D410A4D97E81BBEC40_9F8D1A8C_2954E.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/D4E013C687F9E1D410A4D97E81BBEC40/9F8D1A8C/2954E" vheight=" 310.8pt" vwidth=" 414.55pt" orisrc="/__local/C/5A/6D/292F82DF0BAF6E29A18F36C1A71_17599E0D_26F1B.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 414.55pt;height: 310.8pt"></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/A/23/27/CD02F561ABF02C6B288640233B7_6F8D2D67_2362D.jpeg" width="553" height="335" border="0" vspace="0" hspace="0" title="" alt="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/A2327CD02F561ABF02C6B288640233B7/6F8D2D67/2362D" vheight=" 335px" vwidth=" 553px" orisrc="/__local/B/0F/11/CCFBF41361C11234BC7100256DC_F444EDB3_216C7.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 553px; height: 335px;"></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0em; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">单项赛事成绩</span></p><table align="center" style="font-size: 20px;"><tbody><tr class="firstRow"><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">姓名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">学院</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">组别/项目</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">名次</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">成绩</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">杨采薇</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">集成电路学部</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">女子甲组/100m</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第一名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">13.08</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">杨采薇</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">集成电路学部</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">女子甲组/200m</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第一名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">26.97</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">谢宗睿</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">计科院</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">女子甲组/5000m</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第一名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">19:13.69</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">谢宗睿</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">计科院</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">女子甲组/3000m</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第一名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">11:25.67</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">范正欣</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">体育部</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">女子乙A组/800m</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第一名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">2:25:38</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">许博洋</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">新生书院</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">男子甲组/200m</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第一名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">22.26</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">范正欣</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">体育部</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">女子乙A组/1500m</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第二名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">5:10:79</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">张智昆</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">通信工程学院</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">男子甲组/110m栏</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第二名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">15.54</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">邱群伟</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">机电工程学院</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">男子甲组1500m</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第二名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">4:12:22</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">许博洋</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">新生书院</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">男子甲组/100m</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">第四名</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">11.10</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">张诗翰</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">新生书院</span></p></td><td><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312;